#: userland/apps/reliefcapture/window.cpp:312
msgid ""
"Win+Shift+S: select a screenshot\n"
"Ctrl+N: new capture\n"
"Ctrl+C: copy image\n"
"Ctrl+S: save PNG\n"
"Ctrl+Z: undo\n"
"Ctrl+Y / Ctrl+Shift+Z: redo\n"
"\n"
"Selection: R region, W window, F full screen, Esc cancel.\n"
"Window captures include visible decorations and occlusions.\n"
"Images remain in the clipboard while ReliefCapture is running."
msgstr ""
"Win+Shift+S：选择截图\n"
"Ctrl+N：新建截图\n"
"Ctrl+C：复制图像\n"
"Ctrl+S：保存 PNG\n"
"Ctrl+Z：撤销\n"
"Ctrl+Y / Ctrl+Shift+Z：重做\n"
"\n"
"选区中：R 区域、W 窗口、F 全屏、Esc 取消。\n"
"窗口截图包含实际可见的边框及遮挡内容。\n"
"粘贴图像时请保持 ReliefCapture 运行。"

